OL,3,GNEWSA'Sausage Smuggler' charged over
OL,4,Athefts down trousers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who allegedly stuffed packs of
OL,7,Fsausages down the front of his trousers
OL,8,Fat a petrol station shop has been
OL,9,Fcharged with theft.
OL,11,FDubbed the "Sausage Smuggler", Thames
OL,12,FValley Police said CCTV showed packs of
OL,13,Fsausages being concealed down a man's
OL,14,Ftrousers before he left without paying
OL,15,Ffor the bangers.
OL,17,FHe is accused of rifling through the
OL,18,Fsausage shelf four times at the BP in
OL,19,FNewbury, returning weekly at first and
OL,20,Fthen twice within four days, with the
OL,21,Ftotal value of stolen meat reaching
OL,22,Fnearly #600.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
